{"id":2918,"bodyHtml":"<DIV><div><p>为推进我院2025级新生工作的顺利开展，根据学院本科生朋辈导师的选聘办法，秉持“公开、公平、公正、竞争、择优”原则，经学生自主申请、资格严格审查等环节，并综合考量学业成绩、学生工作经验等因素，现确定赵远洋等15名同学为我院2025级本科生朋辈导师，现予以公示，名单如下：</p><p><br /></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=RMzl7ZUmWRUmlDnVR-8oRlbnl-YUmA2RL4NDLm6RnNlanz70gihFp2hmCIa0L1ybUSh2MSh2L467ozCiMRfkMmGDM8L4nzf2nzvbnm-4UNrFUml8LmffMzfFLzLbnN7Jv2bjo4OeosAZ_5nZQDL0qIbtpYyPLR-8g474LmG4gtA8pUdcc&oid=1059493349&tid=1024&nid=13203&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/29AF5F37D96540B6067C3E0FE79F23BE/B5420A50/139FA\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"500\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=RMzl7ZUmWRUmlDnVR-8oRlbnl-YUmA2RL4NDLm6RnNlanz70gihFp2hmCIa0L1ybUSh2MSh2L467ozCiMRfkMmGDM8L4nzf2nzvbnm-4UNrFUml8LmffMzfFLzLbnN7Jv2bjo4OeosAZ_5nZQDL0qIbtpYyPLR-8g474LmG4gtA8pUdcc&oid=1059493349&tid=1024&nid=13203&e=.png\"></p><p><br /></p><p><br /></p><p>公示时间：2025年5月23日－5月25日。</p><p>在公示期间，对本科生朋辈导师拟任名单如有异议，请向学院学生科反映。</p><p>电话：0351-3557336</p><p><br /></p></div></DIV>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://5y.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=RMzl7ZUmWRUmlDnVR-8oRlbnl-YUmA2RL4NDLm6RnNlanz70gihFp2hmCIa0L1ybUSh2MSh2L467ozCiMRfkMmGDM8L4nzf2nzvbnm-4UNrFUml8LmffMzfFLzLbnN7Jv2bjo4OeosAZ_5nZQDL0qIbtpYyPLR-8g474LmG4gtA8pUdcc&oid=1059493349&tid=1024&nid=13203&e=.png"}